==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
The red enemies in this stage mean almost nothing as they are very frail and just stacking midrange area attacks like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg]] should be able to clear them. Luckily, the starred aliens in this stage are all single target meaning basic meatshielding should just be enough to clear this stage with enough attackers.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
It is about the same stage as Chapter 1, just with two Ribbos and a Shy Boy instead of infinite Pigges. You can use a similar strategy to Chapter 1, just modify it so you can better handle the Shy Boys and Ribbos, like putting in a dedicated [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] such as [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] or an extra unit that can take out the Shy Boys fast, like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]].

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage is similar the second chapter's Aldebaran, but contains a Gardeneel Bros and Spacefish Jones instead of Ribboes. You can use units with high damage against Alien, Floating or Red, such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly/Fishman Cat]] paired with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly kill the Spacefish Jones, as well as dealing with the peons. You can also use stackable units to deal high damage to the Spacefish Jones.

